\right\vert \boldsymbol{\sigma }\right) _{\sigma \sigma }\mathbb{S}_{\rho
\sigma }=\mathcal{R}_{\sigma }\left( S_{\rho \sigma }\right) ^{t}\left(
\left. \boldsymbol{\sigma }\right\vert \boldsymbol{\sigma }\right) _{\sigma
\sigma }\mathcal{R}_{\sigma }\left( S_{\rho \sigma }\right) .
