\mathcal{R}_{\rho }\left( v\right) ^{t}\mathcal{R}_{\rho }\left( T^{t_{\rho
\sigma }}\right) ^{t}\mathbb{S}_{\rho \sigma }\mathcal{R}_{\sigma }\left(
w\right)
