\left( e_{1}\right\vert _{\rho \sigma } \\ 
\vdots \\ 
\left( e_{2r}\right\vert _{\rho \sigma }%
\end{array}%
\right) \left( \overset{}{v}\right) =\left( 
\begin{array}{ccc}
\left\vert e_{1}\right) _{\rho \sigma } & \cdots & \left\vert e_{2r}\right)
_{\rho \sigma }%
\end{array}%
\right) \mathcal{R}_{e}\left( S_{\rho \sigma e}\right) ^{-1}\left( 
