where one has used

\item the change of basis expression 
\begin{equation}
\left( 
\begin{array}{c}
\mathcal{R}_{e}\left( v\right) _{1} \\ 
\vdots \\ 
\mathcal{R}_{e}\left( v\right) _{r}%
\end{array}%
\right) =\left( 
\begin{array}{ccc}
e_{b1}\left( f_{1}\right) & \cdots & e_{br}\left( f_{1}\right) \\ 
